 }
}
-- _given/a/ready --
-- _given/a/a.txt --
a's work
-- _given/a/.kiln/specs/a.amend.md --
# Amendments to .kiln/specs/a.md

## Acceptance test 1: A is ready

### Old

- **Then**: ready is there.

### New

- **Then**: ready and a.txt are there.

### Reason

a.txt is the work.
